	(text "PCA9685 #2, I2C address 0x41 (A0 high). Outputs drive the power bar inputs at 3.3 V\nlike the Robo-Tank v3 GPIOs. /OE fixed to GND, see PCA9685 #1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
